1
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:08,610
The doctors had given up. His life flickered like a lamp in the wind.

2
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:13,430
But that night... a miracle was about to unfold!

3
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:17,119
Abhinav... a 25-year-old software engineer.

4
00:00:17,119 --> 00:00:21,050
The only son of his family. His parents' whole world.

5
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:26,350
One road accident... changed everything in a single moment.

6
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:33,420
I'm sorry... we've done everything we could. Now it's all in God's hands.

7
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:38,640
Don't take my child, God... he is my life!

8
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:45,450
My father always said... there is a mantra that conquers even death.

9
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:49,935
When every door had closed, the father remembered the only way left.

10
00:00:49,935 --> 00:00:55,150
He took out his phone and played the Mahamrityunjaya Mantra on the Mantra Shakti channel.

11
00:00:57,700 --> 00:01:21,000
(He chants the Mahamrityunjaya Mantra)

12
00:01:24,950 --> 00:01:30,710
No one in that ICU that night... would ever forget what they saw.

13
00:01:31,210 --> 00:01:35,125
The sound of the mantra didn't just fill the hospital room.

14
00:01:35,125 --> 00:01:37,050
.. it touched Abhinav's soul!

15
00:01:37,550 --> 00:01:43,150
Just as death's messengers seized his life... a divine power stood in their way!

16
00:01:43,650 --> 00:01:49,650
Where science had no answers... the power of the mantra revealed its true might.

17
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:53,670
Abhinav's heart... began to beat again!

18
00:01:54,220 --> 00:01:56,660
This... how is this possible?!

19
00:01:56,960 --> 00:02:00,920
Abhi... you came back to me, my dear!

20
00:02:01,170 --> 00:02:04,450
Lord Shiva... you heard our prayer.

21
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,360
Amma... that mantra didn't just save me... it sent me back for a great secret!

22
00:02:11,610 --> 00:02:13,850
What is that secret?

23
00:02:14,350 --> 00:02:19,870
The power that sent Abhinav back... what will it do through him now?

24
00:02:20,370 --> 00:02:25,970
To find out... subscribe to Mantra Shakti now for Part 2!

